# USDA FoodData Central key — free: https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-key-signup.html
# Copy to .env (gitignored). Optional: falls back to DEMO_KEY, 30 requests/hour,
# which search exhausts in about five queries (one request per result row).
#
# Keep private. USDA deactivates published keys, and this must never become an
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* var — Expo inlines those into the app bundle. Calling FDC from
# the app needs a server-side proxy that injects this key.
FDC_API_KEY=
